=== 4. talker, zenoh on UART0 = serial monitor, no host side (raw bytes, --serial-log-file) ===
0000000 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 00 02 01 01 01 01 01 01
0000016 01 00 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01 00 02 01 01 01 01
=> zenoh-pico's COBS-framed serial link, 0x00 delimiters intact: the CLI's serial stream is binary-safe.

